## 5. Real-package check: reticle die at 350 W/cm2 (H-Z2 zoning, 1 mm base), case dT at hottest die cell
fit to nonuniform-heatmap sweep: dT_die,max = 33 + 3500/h_eff[kW/m2K] + (R_TIM - 0.05) x 350
| core | h_eff | paste 0.05 | PCM 0.055 | LM 0.015 | T_case,max with LM (45 C in) |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| HMMC-R 0.15/0.10x2.0 | 127 | 60.5 | 62.3 | 48.3 | 93.3 C |
| HMMC-P 0.10/0.10x1.5 | 187 | 51.7 | 53.4 | 39.4 | 84.4 C |
| HMMC-fine 0.075x1.0 (ref) | 239 | 47.7 | 49.4 | 35.4 | 80.4 C |
CoolIT-like C-x-U (from report): 88.6 K paste, Tcase 134 C; junction adds ~ +17 K (lidded) at 350 W/cm2.
Direct-to-die removes lid + TIM1 (0.064 + 0.015 cm2K/W = 28 K at 350 W/cm2 at the junction level).

## 6. Required manifold branch resistance and orifice sizing (18 LPM, 14 inlet slots)
- HMMC-R robust: channel 0.23 kPa -> orifice 1.97 kPa; hole velocity 1.18 m/s, 92 x 0.5 mm holes per 108 mm slot (pitch 1.2 mm)
- HMMC-P performance 0.10/0.10x1.5: channel 0.83 kPa -> orifice 1.37 kPa; hole velocity 0.99 m/s, 110 x 0.5 mm holes per 108 mm slot (pitch 1.0 mm)

